_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_

**Handle spread of named story imports (`...Primary`)**

Right now only namespace spreads are rewritten. A named import spread (`import { Primary } ...; ...Primary`) stays unmodified and will still reference the pre‑CSF4 shape. Add a spread handler for identifiers in `namedStoryImports` so they become `...Primary.input`.

<details>
<summary>Proposed fix</summary>

```diff
   traverse(csf._ast, {
     /**
      * Handle CROSS-FILE story references.
      */
     MemberExpression(nodePath) {
       ...
     },
+
+    // Handle NAMED IMPORTS spread: import { Primary } from './Button.stories'
+    // Usage: ...Primary → ...Primary.input
+    SpreadElement(nodePath) {
+      const arg = nodePath.node.argument;
+      if (t.isIdentifier(arg) && namedStoryImports.has(arg.name)) {
+        nodePath.node.argument = t.memberExpression(arg, t.identifier('input'));
+        nodePath.skip();
+      }
+    },
   });
```
</details>

